      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Cardiac tamponade linked to parenteral nutrition is a rare complication, but often fatal. This clinical study describes a case in which this complication occurs, with a review of literature on the subject and several recommendations for prevention and treatment."},
